    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom detached bungalow boasting spectacular, uninterrupted views over the river Shannon, the surrounding islands and the Clare Hills, located in the picturesque setting of Ringmoylan, Pallaskenry, Co. Limerick \n\nOccupying an elevated site in a peaceful rural setting, this property offers bright and well-proportioned living and bedroom accommodation throughout. While the residence would benefit from some modernisation, it presents excellent potential to create a wonderful family home. The property is set on generous gardens with a tarmac driveway and enjoys a truly exceptional location combining privacy, tranquillity and convenient access to Limerick City. \n\nInspection is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch\nTiled floor.\n\nEntrance hall\nCarpet flooring.\n\nSitting room - 4.6m (15'1\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\nFeature fireplace. Carpet flooring. T.V point.\n\nLiving room - 2.8m (9'2\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nCarpet flooring.\n\nStore room\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.8m (9'2\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nCarpet flooring. Built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.9m (9'6\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nFully tiled. Electric shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 1.6m (5'3\")\nCarpet flooring.\n\nKitchen - 3.6m (11'10\") x 3.5m (11'6\")\nTiled flooring. Solid fuel stove.\n\nDining room - 5m (16'5\") x 3.6m (11'10\")\nCarpet flooring. Patio door to rear.\n\nUtility room - 3.3m (10'10\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\nFully plumbed.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.8m (15'9\") x 3.1m (10'2\")\nCarpet flooring.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spectacular uninterrupted views over the River Shannon </li><li> Panoramic views of the surrounding islands and the Clare Hills </li><li> Approx. 21 km from Limerick City </li><li> Excellent refurbishment potential </li><li> Generous gardens surrounding the property </li><li> Elevated site in rural setting </li><li> Close to Pallaskenry Village and local amenities </li><li> Double glazed PVC windows </li><li> Tarmac driveway with ample parking </li><li> Rare opportunity to acquire a property in an exceptional riverside location</li></ul>"
      },
